      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should absolutely check with your pharmacist or doctor before combining any cough medicine with Sertraline. Some medications can interact with antidepressants, potentially causing side effects. Instead, try a simple humidifier or a warm tea with honey to soothe your cough first; these are safe and effective for most colds. If the cough persists, a doctor can recommend a safe over-the-counter option for you.",
